OL,3,CChannel Islands prepare for most
OL,4,Cstriking solar event so far this
OL,5,Ccentury
OL,7,FThousands of people across the Channel
OL,8,FIslands will look up to the sky on
OL,9,FWednesday evening for what is expected
OL,10,Fto be the most striking solar event so
OL,11,Ffar this century.
OL,13,FExperts say the last time a partial
OL,14,Feclipse of this magnitude happened was
OL,15,F1999, with the next one forecasted to
OL,16,Fbe this good not due until 2080.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/5
