OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786744252
OL,3,CChannel Islands prepare for most
OL,4,Cstriking solar event so far this
OL,5,Ccentury
OL,7,FIt has seen shops sell out of special
OL,8,Fviewing glasses, tables in prime spots
OL,9,Fbooked up and celebratory drinks
OL,10,Fcreated to welcome in the solar
OL,11,Fspectacle.
OL,13,FSpeaking to ITV Channel, NASA
OL,14,Fscientist Dr Kelly Korreck says that
OL,15,F"in the Channel Islands, it really is
OL,16,Fa rare thing".
OL,18,FAnyone wishing to watch the eclipse is
OL,19,Furged to do so safely, either by using
OL,20,Fapproved glasses or DIY methods to
OL,21,Fproject a shadow of the event.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
