PN,35904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786744252
OL,3,CChannel Islands prepare for most
OL,4,Cstriking solar event so far this
OL,5,Ccentury
OL,7,FPeople are getting prepared across the
OL,8,FChannel Islands, including a visiting
OL,9,Fscout group in Jersey for the week.
OL,11,FOne of the troop, Henry, says: "I'm
OL,12,Freally excited. I don't think I'll
OL,13,Fever see one again as well."
OL,15,FJaida adds: "Especially if we're on
OL,16,Fthe beach because it's really
OL,17,Fbeautiful and it will make it even
OL,18,Fbetter."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
