OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786744252
OL,3,CChannel Islands prepare for most
OL,4,Cstriking solar event so far this
OL,5,Ccentury
OL,7,FScout leader Adam Taylor beams: "What
OL,8,Fa place to see it. We've got a
OL,9,Fbeautiful view, it'll go towards their
OL,10,Fspace activity badge as well so it's
OL,11,Fperfect for them."
OL,13,FThe weather conditions are expected to
OL,14,Fbe clear and fine, allowing for a good
OL,15,Fview of the eclipse.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/5
